      "notes.6": "English policy: On-campus MSCS score floors: TOEFL 100/120 or 5/6, IELTS 7.5, plus section minima. Scores normally must remain valid at enrollment; specified expired-score exceptions and degree-based proof need manual review. Citizenship alone no longer establishes proficiency for Fall 2027."
